 r←Test_ProcessTool_016(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;rf;data;parms;globalParms;n;code
⍝ Exercise "ProcessTool" with non-existing callback. In test mode a stub will be created automatically.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 data←{⍵,[0.5]⍵}⍕¨10001+⍳10

 #.⎕SHADOW'MyNS'
 'MyNS'#.⎕NS''

 globalParms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.testMode←1
 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.ProcessTool.CreateParms
 parms.timeout←0.1
 n←globalParms parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.ProcessTool.Create data'#.MyNS.OnHandler'

 1 ⎕NQ n.menubar.editCallback'Select'
 {}1 ⎕NQ n.Btn_00'Select'

 →T.FailsIf 0=#.MyNS.⎕NC'OnHandler'

 code←#.MyNS.⎕NR'OnHandler'
 code,←⊂'GLOBAL←1'
 code←#.MyNS.⎕FX code

 1 ⎕NQ n.Btn_00'Select'
 →T.FailsIf 0=#.MyNS.⎕NC'GLOBAL'
 →T.FailsIf 1≢#.MyNS.GLOBAL

 r←T._OK
